<view class="page"><image class="background" src="{{background}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="content"><view class="brand-head"/><view class="title">当日比赛</view><view class="muted">加入比赛后，到店请向店员出示会员 ID 确认到场。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{!hasLogin}}"><view class="note">登录后即可加入比赛，赛后积分与奖励同步到你的档案。</view><button class="full" bindtap="login">微信登录</button></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><view class="card-heading"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><view class="note">{{item.typeLabel}} · {{item.timeLabel}}（北京时间）</view><view class="note">报名人数 {{item.enrolled_count}} / {{item.capacity}}</view><view class="score" wx:if="{{item.my_status==='joined'||item.my_status==='checked_in'}}">{{item.my_status==='checked_in'?'已确认到场':'已加入 · 到店后请店员确认到场'}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.my_status==='withdrawn'}}">你已退出本场比赛</view><block wx:if="{{item.status==='open'}}"><button class="full button-ghost" wx:if="{{item.my_status==='joined'||item.my_status==='checked_in'}}" disabled="{{busy}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="leave" bindtap="change">退出本场</button><button class="full" wx:else disabled="{{busy||item.enrolled_count>=item.capacity}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="join" bindtap="change">{{item.enrolled_count>=item.capacity?'本场已满':'加入比赛'}}</button></block><view class="note" wx:else>{{item.status==='running'?'比赛进行中，报名已关闭':item.status==='finished'?'比赛已结束，积分与奖励可在个人档案查看':'本场比赛已取消'}}</view></view><view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!rows.length}}">{{loading?'正在加载场次…':'今天暂无比赛场次'}}</view><button class="full button-ghost" disabled="{{busy||loading}}" bindtap="load">刷新场次与状态</button></view></view>
